OL,3,GNEWSALife in the town centre that
OL,4,Abanned balaclavas
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational headlines were made this
OL,7,Fautumn when Nottingham became one of
OL,8,Fthe UK's first cities to bring in a
OL,9,Fbalaclava ban, with neighbouring towns
OL,10,Fand cities now looking to follow suit.
OL,12,FSince September, authorities in the
OL,13,Fcity have had the power to request face
OL,14,Fcoverings are removed and to issue
OL,15,Ffines if they "reasonably believe" they
OL,16,Fare being used to cause trouble -
OL,17,Falthough to date, no fines have been
OL,18,Fhanded out in Nottingham.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
